<title>IRAQ: PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Feb 11.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Feb 11.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the official Iraqi press on Tuesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>THAWRA</p>
<p>- President Saddam Hussein and Moslem and Arab leaders exchange greetings for Eid al-Fitr.</p>
<p>- Saddam receives well-wishers on Eid al-Fitr.</p>
<p>- Work is in progress to implement Badoush dam in Nineveh province.</p>
<p>(The above stories were also carried by IRAQ)</p>
